"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"price_overview":{"currency":"USD","discount_percent":0,"final":499,"final_formatted":"$4.99 USD","initial":499,"initial_formatted":""},"publishers":["Fortell Games"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia fantasiosa","rating":"l"},"igrs":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Kekerasan","rating":"13","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"13","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Fantasy-Gewalt","rating":"6","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"6","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":false,"date":"7 Feb, 2020"},"required_age":0,"reviews":"\u201cStardrone carries on taunting you with its breathless pinball-breakout king of swing madness. It's a complex, abusive relationship, and one you should enter into with your eyes wide open.\u201d<br>80 \u2013 Eurogamer<br><br>\u201cStarDrone is a great take on the action-puzzler sub genre. It looks fantastic and has a pumping, if slightly repetitive, soundtrack. With plenty of replay potential and a lot of well designed, imaginative levels to work through, this could keep you entertained for quite some time.\u201d<br>80 \u2013 TheSixAxis<br><br>\u201cOur compulsion to keep playing &quot;just one more level&quot; meant that our feelings and hands would get hurt along the way, but in the end we liked what we saw.\u201d<br>80 \u2013 GamesRadar+<br>","screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/523890/ss_b0ed70690ce3e712408efceecd5d59ad7a327a44.1920x1080.jpg?t=1768700545","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/523890/ss_b0ed70690ce3e712408efceecd5d59ad7a327a44.600x338.jpg?t=1768700545"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/523890/ss_a31fe32e97aaeb721cb5a77cce2d26aa1e3fa40e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1768700545","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/ap